# `coalesce` returns its first non-null argument.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/edge/nulls.csv'
| project id, n = coalesce(name, 'anonymous'), v = coalesce(value, real(null), 0)
| sort by id asc
---- expected
id   | n         | v
long | string    | real
-----+-----------+-----
   1 | alpha     |  1.5
   2 | anonymous |  2.5
   3 | gamma     |  0.0
   4 | delta     |  4.5
   5 | anonymous |  0.0
